{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_60_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_60","textTraditional":"一、三十有一年，春，築臺於郎。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_60_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_60","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，薛伯卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_60_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_60","textTraditional":"三、築臺於薛。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_60_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_60","textTraditional":"四、六月，齊侯來獻戎捷。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_60_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_60","textTraditional":"齊侯來獻捷者，內齊侯也，不言使。內與同，不言使也。獻戎捷。軍得曰捷，戎菽也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_60_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_60","textTraditional":"五、秋，築臺於秦。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_60_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_60","textTraditional":"不正。罷民三時，虞山林藪澤之利。且財盡則怨，力盡則懟，君子危之，故謹而志之也。或曰，倚諸桓也，桓外無諸侯之變，內無國事，越千里之險，北伐山戎，為燕辟地。魯外無諸侯之變，內無國事，一年罷民三時，虞山林藪澤之利。惡內也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_60_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_60","textTraditional":"六、冬，不雨。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}